cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "OpenPDH-Bench: an open, equilibrium-referenced benchmark of propane dehydrogenation catalyst performance"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
authors:
  - family-names: "Lambert"
    given-names: "Somtochukwu"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, College Station, Texas, USA"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-1386-6141"
    email: "somto.lambert@gmail.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/somtolambert/openpdh-bench"
abstract: >-
  A harmonized, openly licensed dataset of non-oxidative propane dehydrogenation
  catalyst performance extracted from the peer-reviewed literature, with each
  reported conversion placed against the single-reaction equilibrium limit
  computed from public-domain NASA thermodynamic data. Records catalyst
  composition, temperature and its measurement basis, pressure, feed,
  space velocity, conversion, selectivity, deactivation and heating mode.
keywords:
  - propane dehydrogenation
  - propylene
  - heterogeneous catalysis
  - benchmark
  - thermodynamic equilibrium
  - electrified heating
  - open data
